{"repositoryId":1424352270,"availability":"available","full":"roman-postnov/dv-photo-checker","name":"dv-photo-checker","description":"In-browser checker for Diversity Visa lottery photos. Validates the official requirements and crops to 600×600. No uploads, works offline.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-18T12:33:20Z","updated":"2026-10-18T12:34:07Z","branch":"master","homepage":"https://roman-postnov.github.io/dv-photo-checker/","topics":["dv-lottery","face-detection","green-card","mediapipe","photo-checker","privacy","pwa","visa-photo","webassembly"],"demo":"https://roman-postnov.github.io/dv-photo-checker/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T11:49:11.942Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T11:49:11.942Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T11:49:11.942Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T11:49:11.942Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A static web app that checks a photo for the U.S. Diversity Visa (DV) lottery against the Department of State photo requirements, and turns any photo into a compliant 600 × 600 JPEG by cropping and resizing it.","Everything runs in the browser. There is no backend: the face detector (MediaPipe, WebAssembly) and its models are served from the same origin as the page, the photo is never uploaded, and a Content Security Policy (connect-src 'self') prevents the page from sending data anywhere else. After the first visit, a service worker caches the app so it also works offline.","This is an independent tool, not affiliated with the U.S. Department of State. Automated checks are estimates; a consular officer makes the final decision."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/roman-postnov/dv-photo-checker/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"a38ebdf6958f754f36f8a525ea070711630f8e357f4f11c47ca76d94dd48c6f4","extractedAt":"2026-10-19T11:49:12.026Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T11:49:12.026Z","proje